         the order/asset view (HarnessOrderCli), the panel shape convention (StationRule), the world column
         index (FloorFeed). Nothing here is edited by this probe. -->
    <Compile Include="..\_shared\EnablePopulation.cs" Link="EnablePopulation.cs" />
    <Compile Include="..\_shared\EnableArms.cs" Link="EnableArms.cs" />
